  i Splitting the component across two script blocks makes it harder to read. The defineOptions() macro sets the same options inside <script setup>.
  
  i Move these options into a defineOptions() call in the <script setup> block, and remove the default export. Declare props and events with defineProps() and defineEmits() instead.
  
